OL,3,A'No turning back' in independence
OL,4,Ajourney, says first minister at rally
OL,5,
OL,6,F"[Wales is] on a journey, and there's
OL,7,Fno turning back," ap Iorwerth said.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
