OL,3,AGerman town bans 'stumbling stone'
OL,4,Amemorials to Nazi victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plaques, called Stolpersteine in
OL,7,FGerman, are often placed outside the
OL,8,Fhouses where the victims used to live
OL,9,For work. They are frequently funded by
OL,10,Fdonations.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
